0,Muyuw language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muyuw_language,"Muyuw language (Egum, Murua, Murua Dukwayasi, Murua Kaulae, Muruwa, Muyu, Muyua, Muyuwa) is one of the Kilivila–Louisiades languages (of the Austronesian language family), spoken on the Woodlark Islands, in the Solomon Sea within Papua New Guinea.",Muyuw,Austronesian
