7,"Muyuw Language (MYW) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map ...",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/myw/,"Muyuw is a stable indigenous language of Papua New Guinea. It belongs to the Austronesian language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.",Muyuw,Austronesian
